# Evaluator-owned receipts are committed; harness state, workspaces, raw harness logs and per-trial tokens are not.
trials/*/*/*/state/
trials/*/*/*/workspace/
trials/*/*/*/logs/*
!trials/*/*/*/logs/adapter.log
trials/*/*/*/trial.json
*.sqlite-shm
*.sqlite-wal
trials/*/*/*/compose.serve.yaml
# The company brain: the sidecar's per-trial token, tokens.json and run directory (docs/gbrain-arm.md), and every preflight's
# token and sidecar logs, stay out of the repository.
trials/*/*/*/gbrain/
preflight-*/
# The run and proxy logs of each shard are receipts this run's report cites (the repository's root rule ignores *.log).
!run.log
!run-*.log
!proxy.log
!proxy-*.log
!*.run.log
!*.proxy.log
!*.preflight.log
!*.plan.log
!*.run-shard.log
!*.smoke-lease.log
!*.fanout.log
# HARN-8: a sharded run's merge copies each shard's preflight directory as <shard>.preflight-*/ (the member brain's token files are not copied; the
# directory still holds the sidecar logs); the per-trial gbrain/ directory holds tokens.json and ingest-tokens.json under live ingestion.
*preflight-*/
**/ingest-tokens.json
**/tokens.json
# HARN-15 anatomy-instruction-route-2026-11: each trial's route records, as the preregistration's Receipts list names them.
!trials/*/*/*/logs/instruction-route.json
!trials/*/*/*/logs/ready
!trials/*/*/*/logs/instruction-route.openclaw.json
!trials/*/*/*/logs/instruction-route.hermes.log
!*.lane.log
!instruction-route-goldens.log
!fanout.out
